{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Quest log: the Extra Quests window lists, promotes and abandons overflow quests",
  "contract": [
    "The client cannot show overflow quests, so the server sends them over the COAQLOG addon channel to the Extra Quests window: BEGIN <count> <capacity>, one Q line per quest with its objectives, END.",
    "The window's Move to Quest Log button sends PROMOTE <quest>, which swaps the quest with the idlest native quest. Abandon sends ABANDON <quest>. The client's own abandon packet reaches only its 25 slots, so it cannot remove an overflow quest; an empty overflow log is announced with EMPTY."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 90000,
  "quest_log_size": 64,
  "players": [
    {
      "id": "hero",
      "race": 1,
      "class": 1,
      "level": 20
    }
  ],
